WEBVTT

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.540
Ahem...

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:18.120
Do you know about cats?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.410
Cute ears that wiggle sensitively...

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.700
Tails that wag expressively,
responding to emotions...

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.790
Attached to a bipedal creature
of the utmost charm...

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.540
Do you like cats like that?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.750
If so, please visit this patisserie.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.540
The cutest cats you've
ever seen await you there!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.950
Welcome!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.290
Welcome to La Soleil!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:56.500
Chocola, wake up. It's morning.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.950
Chocola... Chocola.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.580
Mm... Master...

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:12.540
Please don't over-trim Chocola's nails...

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.870
Hey! That tickles!

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:39.870
This is a breast-kneading motion--
part of our instinct as cats.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:43.620
Wait, but you were kneading
Chocola's stomach.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.500
Hmm... Good point.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.370
Oh, you're finally awake.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:03.700
Good morning, Master!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.450
Morning, Master.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.200
Yes, good morning.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.370
Hey, what's for breakfast?

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.160
We're having bacon and eggs today.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.620
Wow!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.620
Chocola loves bacon and eggs!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.700
Go wash your face, then it's breakfast time.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.370
Yes.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.410
Chocola, that's not what he meant.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.620
Let's eat!

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:37.870
Mm, delicious!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:42.290
Vanilla, we have to admit,
Master's cooking is the best!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.290
Chocola, don't talk while eating.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.080
You just launched something.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.830
Cats grow so quickly...

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:57.540
When we found them back home,
they couldn't even use chopsticks properly.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:04.040
Now they're able to help me in my shop.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.950
I still remember what a surprise
it was to see them here, though.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.200
"Danger! Fragile! This side definitely up!"
"Danger! Fragile! Throw this box
and we will shut your business down!"
What are these massive boxes...?

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.580
They look like stuff from home, but...

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:16.950
--I guess I'll find out if I open them--

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.040
--Ah-choo!
--I guess I'll find out if I open them--

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:30.120
Now that I think about it, to be safe,
I shouldn't open boxes I don't recognize.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.200
The movers must have made a mistake.
I'll just send them back.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.080
I should call them right away.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.620
Don't do that!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:46.700
Um... Hello, l-long time no see, Master?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.830
I just saw you back home yesterday.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.660
So the other box must be...

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:57.540
Wherever Chocola is, that's where I am.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.120
This must be Shigure's doing.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.750
N-No!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:04.750
When you decided to start your shop
and live alone, I didn't talk to Shigure-<i>chan</i>.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.620
I really wanted to stay with you,
so she didn't come up with a plan.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:15.250
I didn't hide inside your things so that
I could just show up and live with you!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.700
Chocola, you just confessed to everything.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.080
First things first, just get out of there.
We can discuss more after that.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.910
Since I ended up letting them stay here,

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.410
I guess I have to admit I'm soft on cats.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.250
Master.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:35.950
If you're not eating those
bacon and eggs, Chocola will...

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:38.040
No.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.830
Yes. He is giving those to me.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.040
Why?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.080
What's up, Shigure?

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.700
Oh, nothing...

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.370
You've gotten quite good at that.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:09.000
Yeah, I cook breakfast every other day.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.910
Naturally, I'd get a bit better.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.830
Right... Sure.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.870
So... is there anything for me to help with?

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.040
Don't worry about it.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:24.580
Remember how we set up a schedule
to have us cats make breakfast?

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:28.290
Yes, you're right, but...

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.330
Why don't you give Nuts there a hand?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.410
Um... What's Coconut doing?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.040
I'm making sure the rice cooker
doesn't mess up the rice!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.080
Huh...?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.540
You know how dangerous it is
to give Coconut a knife, right?

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.660
Brace yourself, fish!

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.660
Right...

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.370
That's why I gave her a safe assignment.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.410
I-I see...

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:08.700
Hey May-chan, aren't you done yet?
Aren't you coming out?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:13.330
You have to hurry, or else I... I...

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:17.830
Fine, I heard you!
I'm coming out, don't rush me!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:23.750
If you don't come out soon,
I'm going to let it out...

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:31.660
Cinnamon is like this every morning.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.290
Did Shigure mess up her toilet training?

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.160
Wow, looks delicious!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.620
Azuki worked very hard today.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.250
I helped, too!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.000
Yes, you did.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.200
Let's eat.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.370
Let's eat!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.040
Let's eat!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.040
Our cats are so energetic, as always.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.450
I hope Chocola and Vanilla
are doing well at dear brother's?

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.410
Good.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.290
Looks like the shop is ready to open.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.700
All ready!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.160
Nothing missed.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:37.040
Okay, let's begin.

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.700
I'm counting on you two, as usual!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.580
--Yes!
--Leave it to me.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.370
Good, all done.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.000
They say sleeping children grow fast,

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.910
but does she really want to get even bigger?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.500
Ouch! What was that for?!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.660
Sorry, I just couldn't hold back.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.250
Oh, what, you want some?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.700
Come on, May-chan, hurry.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.540
I know.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.750
Azuki and Coconut are at it again...

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:58.080
May-chan, what are you doing?! Hurry!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:05.160
We're already late because you said you
wanted to change your panties before we left!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.910
That's because you wouldn't come out
of the bathroom, so I let a bit out--

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.830
A-Anyway, let's hurry!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.660
Hey, Mom. Look--cats.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.040
Oh, yes, you're right.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.540
Leaving their house with
their bells, how impressive.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.450
Bells? Can they leave
their houses if they wear a bell?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.870
Yes, that's right.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:51.330
Cats aren't allowed to leave their houses
unless their masters are with them.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:55.000
But they can, if they're wearing a bell.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.870
I see.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:11:02.080
But they have to pass a difficult test
to get a bell, it's very tough.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:06.080
So those cats must be, like, really smart!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.120
Bye-bye!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.370
Let's hurry! We'll be late!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:27.120
Maple and Cinnamon are late!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.830
If they don't come soon, Chocola will
get dizzy with a grumbling hungry stomach!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.290
Trying to hide her stomach rumble...
Chocola, so cute.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.500
Wow, what a cute shop!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.290
I know right?

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:45.450
Welcome! This way, please!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:52.540
Four limited-edition melting puddings,
comes out to 1,555 yen.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.830
That other one was cute, too,
but that white cat is super cute!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:58.750
This shop is so relaxing.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:04.830
Thank you for waiting!
Here is your in-season fruits tart.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:07.160
Wow, looks delicious!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.700
Um... Hello?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:20.830
Do you... want a bite?

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.950
Are you sure?!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.330
Sure, why not?

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:26.040
Here, open wide...

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:37.450
My apologies. Unfortunately, we don't allow
our customers to feed our employees.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.580
O-Oh, is that so...

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:46.620
Maple and Cinnamon are so late...

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:47.870
"Changing"
Come on--hurry, hurry!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.450
Come on--hurry, hurry!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.830
I know!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.580
Good.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.410
Yes, perfect.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.750
Sorry!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.580
We're late!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.410
Oh, there you are.

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:05.120
Please relieve the other two.

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:10.450
I'm afraid Chocola is about to
pounce on a customer's cake.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:17.200
Welcome to the patisserie "La Soleil."

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:21.620
Two guests, this way please.
Here is your seat.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.080
Open wide.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.910
Oh, I like that.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:38.120
Open wide.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:53.080
Oh, if she did that, I-I would...

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.830
...get so damp!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.000
We're so sorry we were late today.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.700
No problem. It was only
like ten minutes anyway.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.410
That is a problem!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.450
Chocola was about to
fall unconscious from hunger!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.910
Sorry!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.370
It's okay to be a little late.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:19.120
It's so great to get your help.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.950
Chocola also forgives you,
taking a hint from Master's kindness!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.000
Thanks.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:33.750
Oh... I almost forgot. I put some
seared tuna in the upstairs fridge.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:35.870
It's for your dinner.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.830
--Huh?
--Tuna!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:44.910
Shigure gave it to us.
She got hold of some fresh tuna,

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.700
and wanted her dear brother
and his cats to enjoy it.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.450
Oh, I can't wait! It's so delicious!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.750
Yes.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:59.660
Yeah, especially with some ponzu vinegar,
my face would melt...

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:00.790
Oh!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.000
What's wrong?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.870
I forgot, she asked us
to take some ponzu as well.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:09.040
You have ponzu here, don't you?

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.330
No, I don't think I do...

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.500
It's fine, we'll just use soy sauce.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:19.330
What? But... it's such delicious tuna...

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:23.000
In that case, Chocola will
run out and go buy some!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:26.700
Chocola will be super fast,
so please wait for Chocola.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.200
Don't start without Chocola!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.410
Oh, hey...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.540
Chocola is so full of energy, as always.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:39.290
I really envy her unlimited stamina.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.700
I should shower her with
compliments when she gets back.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.750
Master.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.870
I can be in charge of that.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:48.700
Uh, okay...

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:55.830
♪ Ponzu, ponzu, ponzu for delicious tuna! ♪

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.000
Oh, I know. Shortcut!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:28.080
When Chocola gets back, Master will
surely shower Chocola with praise!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:33.290
Then he might play with Chocola
using some new toys,

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:37.250
and perhaps Vanilla can groom
Chocola's hair after our bath!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.200
All right, speed up!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:02.250
♪ Ponzu, ponzu, ponzu for delicious tuna... ♪

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.830
Hey, you there...

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:19.200
What are you doing all alone?
Where is your master?

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:25.580
Uh, u-um...

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:30.790
Hey, where is your house?
Do you live nearby?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.660
Oh, are you hungry?

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:46.450
Um, did Chocola have something with her?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.370
I might... Over here...

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.750
Got it! There!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:55.370
Colorful chocolates that Chocola
got for snacks the other day!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.700
Wait, what?!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.500
Hey! What's wrong?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.410
Hmm...?

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.410
What got into her...?

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:18.540
If Chocola leaves this here, that girl
can eat it by the time Chocola gets back.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:22.830
Wait, what was Chocola doing
out here in the first place?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.330
Oh, right! Ponzu!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.250
Vanilla and the Master are waiting!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.250
--Master.
--No.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.120
I haven't said anything yet.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.660
If you had a quick bite with some soy sauce,

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:46.580
Chocola would hold it against you
for the rest of your lives.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.910
Ugh... That is quite probable.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:19.950
Hmm...?

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:22.870
Oh, she ate the chocolate.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:29.790
I wonder if she was waiting for
her master to come pick her up?

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:35.290
That's probably it.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:40.370
Otherwise, why would
a bell-less cat be out here alone?

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:57.120
♪ Ponzu, ponzu, ponzu for delicious tuna! ♪

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.950
I'm home!

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:04.910
Hmm?

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:07.870
Huh?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.870
"Illustration by Takahiro Tsurusaki"
